      "notes": "origin fetch+push both https://github.com/lichman0405/SURE.git; gh auth active as lichman0405; branch claude/v0.1-autonomous tracking origin; added scripts/git-guard.mjs enforcing canonical remote, no-force-push fast-forward check and protected-branch refusal. Three-way guard self-test passes."
